+| 24 | 96–101 | `rule-e0dab4a9b20997030cfca78b7b30e2b46b8e7ec4b5649685518b6d53684edc98` | `DOMAIN_LEMMA` | Reverse orientation of the same accumulated odd-count recurrence. |
