+| 6 | 42 | `rule-039beca211ce6b817aac64ca6bf2feac799b0609c7717fd19e4c10cd73dedf18` | `DEFINITION` | Guarded symbolic form of the same `oddPos(0)` defining equation; its `simplification` attribute is permitted. |
